    "text": "HOW IT WORKS\n\nThe computer\u2019s clock is the\nmilliseconds since the\nworkshop opened. Tell shows\nreading minus a START.\n\nThe number announces its\nswitch: [listen | switch |\nbird] gives a nest that gets\n\"on\" or \"off\". Started hears\n\"on\", forgets the start and\nasks the number what it\nshows; Zero sets the start\nso the count goes on from\nthere. Ask and Tell take\nturns by the go pad."
